chore(ci): adopt unified Velnor workflow (#4)

## Summary
- replace the fleet consumer with the exact generated class workflow
- bind each owner mirror to its verified 2026.8.17 immutable target
- preserve the sole `lane` selector and fail-closed `ci-required`
aggregator

## Verification
The canonical generator passed 90 tests, clippy, fmt, and the exact
28/4/4 fleet audit. The fixture rollout passed the Velnor contract at
the same release.

